// # Serverless FaaS, MicroVMs & Cold-Start Optimization Facade
//
// Logline: Unified standard library facade re-exporting MicroVMs, Cold-Start Optimizers, Invocation Routers, and Workflows.
//
// Setup: Pure module shim importing all 49 companion submodules and exposing top-level system entry points.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Import MicroVM, cold start, invocation routing, lifecycle, workflow, and observability submodules.
//   2. Re-export typed public constructors and execution facade helpers.
//   3. Maintain unified standard library entry point for cloud_faas subsystem.

